graph LR
  subgraph 配置层
    P[tenant.mode]
    P1[standalone]
    P2[multi]
    P --> P1
    P --> P2
  end
  subgraph 装配层
    R[TenantResolver 接口]
    R1["StandaloneTenantResolver<br/>ConditionalOnProperty"]
    R2["MultiTenantResolver<br/>ConditionalOnProperty"]
    R --> R1
    R --> R2
  end
  subgraph 运行层
    F[TenantResolutionFilter]
    C[TenantContext ThreadLocal]
    M[MyBatis-Plus TenantLineInnerInterceptor]
    D[(MySQL 业务表)]
  end
  P1 -.激活.-> R1
  P2 -.激活.-> R2
  R1 --> F
  R2 --> F
  F -->|setTenantId| C
  C -->|getTenantId| M
  M -->|自动注入 tenant_id| D
